ncent-Hunyuan/HY-Motion-1.0","text","identity","项目身份与署名","value","HY-Motion is published by the official Tencent-Hunyuan organization. Reuse its verified original Tencent Hunyuan brand mark, also used for Hunyuan3D.","language","en","获取方式","model","access","section","源码",[82],{"_62":83,"_25":68,"_84":85},"Motion implementation source","note","Public inference and visualization implementation with separately linked weights; no complete game project.","interactive","演示",[89],{"_62":90,"_25":91,"_84":92},"Interactive motion demo","https://huggingface.co/spaces/tencent/HY-Motion-1.0","Official text-to-motion model interface; a motion preview rather than playable gameplay. Hosted availability may vary.","教程",[95],{"_62":96,"_25":97,"_84":98},"Installation and motion workflow","https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/HY-Motion-1.0/blob/master/README.md","Official setup, CLI inference, local UI, and prompting guidance. Local execution requires the documented GPU resources.","来源核查","2026-10-18","verified","metadata","年份","2025","year","list","适用方向","ordered",false,[112],"dimensions","3D","开发阶段",[116],"stages","资产与动画","主题",[120,121,122,123,124],"tags","Text-to-motion","Skeletal animation","Humanoid","Model weights","Local inference","延伸阅读",[127,128,129],{"_62":133,"_25":134},{"_62":123,"_25":132},{"_62":130,"_25":131},"HY-Motion community license","https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/HY-Motion-1.0/blob/master/License.txt","https://huggingface.co/tencent/HY-Motion-1.0","Official project","https://hunyuan.tencent.com/motion","项目源码",[137],{"_62":135,"_25":68},"用途与特点","腾讯文生动作模型提供 CLI 推理、本地 Gradio 可视化和托管演示，输出可作为动画流程输入并重定向到目标角色。文档列出非人形动作、多角色交互、无缝循环和原地动画等限制；发布内容不是可控制角色或完整游戏。专用许可排除欧盟、英国和韩国，并限制利用作品或输出改进 HY-Motion 及其衍生之外的 AI 模型。采用前检查完整条款与商业使用门槛。","detail","guidance","资源类型","工具","分类","游戏制作","category","lead","summary","name","production","tool",[165,166,167],{"_160":161,"_162":163,"_32":164},[120,121,122,123,124],[159],[158],2025,"3d","assets","tutorial",{"_62":96,"_25":97,"_17":160,"_84":98